    Notes
    ● 3 private channels will be migrated. At taut finalize their Slack
      members are added to the team as well as to the channel, because Teams
      only lets members of a team into its private channels. They will see the
      team's other channels.
      └ To keep them out of those, give private channels a team of their own in
        the config file (target.teams).

